        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Joe Foss\n- Events: Guadalcanal Campaign\n- Military operations: Operation Watchtower\n- Awards: Medal of Honor\n- Places: Guadalcanal, Pacific theater\n- Topics: World War II, air combat\n\nFacts:\n- The Guadalcanal Campaign, also known as the Battle of Guadalcanal and codenamed Operation Watchtower, was fought from 7 August 1942 to 9 February 1943 on and around Guadalcanal in the Pacific theater of World War II.\n- Joe Foss received the Medal of Honor in recognition of his role in air combat during the Guadalcanal Campaign.",
